msgid "pse_VALID_PSEUDONYM_NAMES"
msgstr " The pseudonym should contain only lower-case letters, numbers, period, hyphen and underscore and should start with a lower-case letter or number. For example \"sales\", \"john.holland\", \"123\" and \"email-administrator\" are all valid pseudonyms, but \"John Smith\" and \"Henry Miller\" are not. You can also create email aliases for accounts and (virtual) domains that are valid on this server. For example \"fred@virtualdomain.com\" can be forwarded to \"mary\" (or to another valid user account). "
